The coverage run exposed a real parallel-runner collision (exit 1): the conformance suite and the original libssh2 loopback suite were invoking the same integration flows concurrently, producing `writeAfterEOF`. I’m nesting the new suite under the existing serialized libssh2 suite so its serialization trait governs both the original cases and the conformance replay; the failing gate stays failing until that is verified.
